    <item>
      <title>1.1.1</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 07:19:42 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>ThorReborn now updates itself.</p><ul><li>Check for Updates works, from the menu bar or Settings, signed with Sparkle.</li><li>New &quot;Automatically check for updates&quot; setting.</li><li>Releases are now signed with a stable certificate, so updates keep your Accessibility permission.</li><li>App icons for symlinked apps (like Safari) no longer show an alias arrow.</li></ul><p>Coming from 1.0.0? That version can&#x27;t update itself, so download this one by hand, quit ThorReborn, and replace the app in Applications. Future updates install from inside the app.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/marclundgren/thor-reborn/releases/download/v1.1.1/ThorReborn.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="TkUFNuPaCrELTJaf+1gfAix1gfi5F2TxfJY6Wgd7Lmhgccg29L2l53l6pS6E8Go0ilpNB1agWh3mD8czlw7XDQ==" length="2273779"/>
